{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20268FnKOjYVOo1792419179.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>四川綿陽北川縣發生4.1級地震。</p><p></p><p>根據中國地震台網，地震在周一晚6時57分發生，震源深度11公里，成都、重慶、陝西漢中等地均有震感。當局稱，暫時無收到任何傷亡和財產損失報告。</p><p></p><p>省地震局已啟動應急處置工作，並指派工作組趕赴現場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:22:14.723106+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:17.174124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:17.174124+00:00","content_hash":"2e14a343552592c6c7bb6996946b130605a35b3ef8e9406b867c8ee6edac5567","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}